Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Silicon, the foundation of modern technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every transistor placed with purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every watt wrestled from physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:18.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where every instruction set earns its right to execute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:20.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how performance gets driven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,How efficiency gets built.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,How intelligence acts, not just answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our future is with ecosystems shaped by architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Capable of connecting technologies, tools, and partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Powerful enough to execute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Efficient enough to scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Familiar enough to build with speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:54.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, it's about the progress we scale through open platforms, shared standards, and partnerships amplifying each other's strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:57.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,A unified architecture engineered for systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:02.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next chapter is being written in silicon with our engineering at its heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:03.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:04.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built on Intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,please give a warm welcome to the CEO of Intel,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lid
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.65,0:01:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Po
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh this is the Elephant Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, 1,000 step 284 m.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,And came down with one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, but if I walk a little bit slower, then you know uh I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:10.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,But anyway, it's a beautiful view.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, I highly recommend all of you to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yep, I think first of all, I think uh delighted to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh this is a important event.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then I'd like to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And about nearly six decades ago a group of brilliant and highly motivated engineers and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,venture capitalists uh including Arthur Rock Don Valentine and many others they found companies like Intel,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Apple, and others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Broadly set the motion the largest economic known to mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh create what became known as Silicon Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:03.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh this is a very exciting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:11.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that is a very same ambition and mindset with the semiconductors make across the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:14.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The spark the creation of Silicon Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right here in Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I have been very fortunate to associate with the creation of semiconductor industry in Taiwan 40 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:30.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh because uh 40 years ago uh Minister K.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li uh Li Kwoh-Ting to turn uh invite me to lay the foundation of venture capital concept in Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:42.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a very new concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh and I'll you people put money with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you play the money, and then you share the profit of 20%, but you don't share 20% of the losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is a very unique uh venture capital concept, but I managed to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then with the help of Minister K.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li and then development fund, and I set up my venture fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:17.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And about the same time, you know, uh uh Morris Chang uh from TI came back to ITRI and then then set up the TSMC.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's a very exciting time that I'm being involved in this whole science
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,park and uh Hsinchu Science Park and the foundation of become the Silicon Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I really see the benefit of, you know, uh from OEM,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,ODM, from design to manufacturing, it's all here in Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taiwan PC ecosystem has played a critical role uh in Intel growth and success.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I In fact, last year I was here uh to celebrate Intel 40th anniversary in Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:05:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of the suppliers, partners, and customers for 40 years of partnership with Intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,As partnership continue to grow, Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,As partnership continue to grow and uh stronger every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It had been a year since I stepped in uh the role of Intel CEO.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,To be more precise, 14 months uh to being CEO of Intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it may be the first CEO can speak Mandarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in fact, of uh customer of Taiwan, very important partner for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:06:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,is that they all also very unusual have a CEO can drink liquor with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But anyway, it's I'm part of this community.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Execution has always always at the top of my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,To do so, we had that to bring focus back to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:19.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh at our heart, Intel is a engineering company.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's what I decided from day one I came to become CEO of Intel, I have all the engineering report to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that understanding to really drive the engineering drives success in engineering uh performing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our customer and partners are always uh you know, already seen the shift uh in the Intel showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:47.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, stay tuned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.59,0:06:49.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a journey in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Opportunity ahead is enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And our job is to stay focused, execute, and deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every year,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:13.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel ship hundred millions of uh hundreds of millions of uh SOC orchestrating silicon across every industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Working tightly with our partners ecosystem across each layer of the stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,From silicon to SOC to system and to software.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This generates trillions of dollars in value across four core compute ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, personal computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second, edge, agentic AI and later physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Third, foundational data centers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:08:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally, emerging intelligence centers that will power digital agents of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each of these ecosystem represent generational opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.16,0:08:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And increasingly, each of these will need purpose-built CPU, GPU,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and A6 solutions caters for specific workloads and application.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The silicon we are building now will be for human use and the digital agent use.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us begin with the ecosystem that started all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.76,0:08:42.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,To talk more about about the PC ecosystem,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.19,0:08:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,please join me to welcome to stage our new leaders for client compute and physical AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:00.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:01.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:04.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lip-Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,A story about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first time I came to Taiwan was the year 1990.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:19.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I was fresh out of school, first job, first international trip, and I came right here in Taipei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I quickly realized even back then that you know, this the the desire to grow,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh the mindset of win-win and cooperation is all over all of our customers and our partners here in Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, forward the clock 36 years, I'm here in my first international trip with all the great people here at Intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And where do I come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right here to Taipei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to plan and build the future with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a lot to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel has continuously increased the pace of progress across all PC segments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Workstations, desktops, creators, gamers, premium and mainstream laptops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.12,0:10:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every major segment, every major segment is driven by an Intel system solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,With that vast coverage in mind, we're adding another dimension to scale these products even more effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Intel 18A process is now at full scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a full lineup of products with hundreds of design wins to prove that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,At CES, we launched the Core Ultra Series 3, Intel's first product built on 18A process technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:11:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's setting a new standard for premium mobile performance and battery life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ultra Series 3 enables great user experiences across any tasks with a very fast response CPU,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:19.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,a highly improved GPU, low power processing NPU, and the latest multimedia capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:28.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect blend of IP, performance, and power for any AI and agentic experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's allowing us to lead the way to transform every PC, every PC to an agentic capable platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, more than 300 designs are shipping across consumer and commercial segments, over 300.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And to scale these capabilities even further,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:12:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,we've taken the latest Core Ultra IPs and specifically tailored them for the mainstream market.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The result?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Intel Core Series 3, introduced in April.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me repeat, we just introduced this in April.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's already scaled up to 70 plus designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,That brings Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,That brings the total series lineup to nearly 400 designs in just a few short months.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:34.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, that is massive scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's look at some of the capabilities of the Core Series 3, and we can start with battery life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, I can go over these numbers here that are printed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:49.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I can talk about how we measure them and things like that, but I I have a question for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,How long is your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,12 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,14 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:13:00.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or more like us at Intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the great user experience is if your PC lasts longer than your work day, and that's exactly what we're delivering in all segments.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we support ample number of ports for all of your connectivity needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unlike some of our competitors who only have one USB-C interface, but I'll let you be the judge of that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:38.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The goal of this uh platform Core Series 3 is to bring premium feel and experiences to incredibly thin form factors for mainstream PCs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:41.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you know, you don't have to take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:51.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can look at this wall of incredibly designed sleek PCs that are here, and all of it is thanks to you, our partners and our customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, please, a round of applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't it awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:04.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Super light, super thin, really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the next proof is scaling 18A IP into growing markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the fastest growing portion of the PC market is the handheld gaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:38.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:57.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,take
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:05.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Arc G3.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think a beautiful chip, more beautiful than was presented yesterday at the keynote.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The G3 is derived from the Core Ultra Series 3, and Arc G3 is a tuned high-performance GPU specifically for handheld gaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's providing great battery life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The performance tested across multiple games is consistent and stable versus competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.72,0:16:14.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are more than 40% faster, 40% faster, and at the same performance, we're half the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, we're running all AAA games at 1080p resolution, many of them above 120 frames per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:29.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, that is giving gamers a great user experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of these devices will be available later this month, and is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.05,0:16:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to have plenty more designs coming throughout the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:43.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:50.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, it is indeed true that Intel has a leading lineup of processors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with the versatility of the 18A process technology, our newest offerings,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:17:02.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're bringing powerful performance and efficiency to scale across the breadth of premium,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:09.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,mainstream, and handheld gaming segments.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,These same fundamentals, the same IP, the same capabilities, can deliver far beyond the PC ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The demand for our processors at the edge has been booming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you've seen, we've already taken existing product lines and pivoted them into adjacent markets,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,enabling our customers to grow their businesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:42.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the edge is demanding the latest products from Intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's why this year we're taking our latest Series 3 products into the edge business with over 130 designs in multiple verticals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:18:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,For large-scale edge business, our customers need the best technology and chipsets,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:06.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,easy-to-use reference designs, and appropriate software stacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And at Intel, we've done all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have over 4,000 edge ecosystem partners deploying into such verticals such as manufacturing, robotics, retail, and many more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,For those of you here at Computex, you can see some of that at the pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:35.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given that capability, given the IP, given the chipsets, given the scale that we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's a massive opportunity ahead of us across many segments of physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's projected to be a 25 trillion market by 2050.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:53.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it will leverage all of our scale in the PC ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:19:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical AI form factors will take shape across key industries as you see behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will continue growing these markets with the same strategy of leading IP and chipsets, complete reference platforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:20.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,of end-user hardware, and applicable software stacks, enabling our customers to expand into new physical AI form factors and applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And indeed, this will be our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:26.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, back to you, Lipu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh thanks, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is profoundly impacting the way we use our devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,A major focus area for us is the use of AI on device.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together with partners, we are at the forefront of advancing intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:00.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,To tell you more about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me welcome on stage my
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,close friend and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:15.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,founder CEO of Perplexity,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aravind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, Aravind, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:25.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You and I have been talking about hybrid compute for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.61,0:20:29.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reason why are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.12,0:20:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, the privacy, cost, performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let's talk about how to make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, in February, we launched Perplexity Compute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:45.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute is an AI operating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It creates a team of agents, uses up to 20 different AI models,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it orchestrates across models, tools, and files in one single system.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.68,0:21:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agent harness inside Compute is model agnostic, perfectly balancing intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,accuracy, privacy, and cost is the orchestration problem it solves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, this allows you to run smaller models locally on the Intel Core Ultra Series 3 GPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, for the first time ever, we work together to create hybrid generative inference.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:36.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, what we're showing today is just the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hybrid generative inference is how we maximize token value per watt per user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.08,0:21:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, should we show them how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:21:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:09.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's say I'm an associate at a private equity firm, and I'm working on something that has a confidential project code name Project Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here is the query.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.36,0:22:21.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, think of it as me trying to understand if a certain private company is worth $1.1 billion,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.69,0:22:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I'm feeding it And I'm feeding it confidential deal materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The work begins on the laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It sees that Project Falcon has private deal room files.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:47.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And an NDA, a local leverage buyout financial model, a whiteboard diagram, and bilingual transcripts that are very confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.06,0:22:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't want these materials to be shipped to the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:23:01.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, what the local model does on the Core Ultra Series 3 is it first decides this is all very important work and shouldn't be sent to the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.41,0:23:05.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It reads the files, classifies what is sensitive and what is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then computer decides what should leave the device and what shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.44,0:23:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And each of these things is done with local AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.12,0:23:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The orchestrator can spin up additional agents as necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.68,0:23:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, if you need a research agent to bring in outside file materials against local model without exposing any private files,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:34.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's what you want in the hybrid system.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, computer or acts as one single system, brings all inputs and outputs together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, let's actually skip and see what the actual result would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the result is a document, a research report, and supporting data.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:24:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's being created by agents on large cloud-based models keeping your sensitive information only on your device.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:11.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, all your local device models will take care of the private files,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the server-side models will take care of other things through hybrid inference orchestration.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the architecture we both believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the future is more compute in the data center and more compute on the local machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.36,0:24:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I think of this as a big milestone for engineering on both the agent harness AI side as well as the chip side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, um it's been really fun to partner with you and Intel on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.29,0:24:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, thank you so much, Lip-Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:44.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.82,0:24:48.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Arvind, and looking forward to continue partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.32,0:24:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.24,0:25:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talk a lot about the exciting new developments in the PC, Edge, and physical AI space.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.36,0:25:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to take a few minutes to talk about the foundational IP that power all these advancements.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us talk about x86.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.48,0:25:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,When most people think of general-purpose computing, they think x86.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.80,0:25:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that is a good reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:36.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,x86 is architecture that has power data center for nearly five decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:38.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the leadership continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:41.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh according to the IDC,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.39,0:25:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,expect eight out of the 10 servers installed through 2030 to be x86 base.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:26:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Powering modern computing from foundational to emerging intelligent use cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel pioneered most of the breakthrough architecture innovation that have enhanced x86 over the last four decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.53,0:26:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Starting with the 8086 that become the foundation of modern computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:21.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh you can see the chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.74,0:26:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we have two flagship CPU cores.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.72,0:26:28.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,P-cores and E-cores.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.88,0:26:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,One optimized for performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,One the others is for efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.80,0:26:43.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,These are Intel's most advanced CPU cores with the accelerator
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.57,0:26:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,building built in uh specifically for foundational workloads like security.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.12,0:27:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our x86 cores power our PC, client, edge portfolio, and also power our data center and AI portfolio.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.00,0:27:10.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Under my leadership, we are committed to building the best CPU cores in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we will enhance and sure that the most compute intensive workload run best on 8086. x86.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.64,0:27:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next, let us talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.72,0:27:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.80,0:27:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, let us talk about how x86 is enabling foundational data centers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.80,0:27:37.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,To tell you more about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.51,0:27:49.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me invite on to the stage Kavouk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.08,0:27:50.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.20,0:27:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.52,0:27:52.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so great to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:28:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh specifically in this point in our history, global history, collective history, and be at Computex with a blue badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.35,0:28:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.24,0:28:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very humbled to be here to share with you some of the innovations that we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh let's talk [snorts] a bit about uh see what this AI thing is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.88,0:28:21.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we say foundational, we mean the workloads that keep the world running.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, currently we have data centers, and there's a number of items and workloads and entities that run on these data centers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.76,0:28:36.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh for example, we have 5G networks that uh keep us connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.36,0:28:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have databases that keep our data safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.20,0:28:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have cloud services that power our daily lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:55.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we expect and demand for these workloads to to grow in size and capacity between now and 2030 from 80 gigawatts to about 100 gigawatts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:29:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And yeah, most of you involved in this domain understand the the the the extent of this type of an expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.48,0:29:11.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,These workloads are broad, they are mission critical, so attention, especially attention has to be taken when running them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.98,0:29:18.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,But [clears throat] also they require performance, efficiency, security and resiliency.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.18,0:29:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we can't emphasize enough all these four factors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is why we are excited to have Intel Xeon 6 Plus introduced at the Computex this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.12,0:29:42.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has 288 e-cores, a massive 576 megabytes of L3 cache, built with our Intel 18A technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.54,0:29:50.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we can't emphasize enough the the value of Intel technology that brings to data center products.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,But most importantly, it delivers efficiency and density,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:30:06.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,which enables our partners to save very precious real estate, have more compact servers and the racks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.28,0:30:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is a leadership compute for the next era of cloud and network infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.92,0:30:16.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.15,0:30:25.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xeon 6 Plus launches with the strength of our ecosystem that's been built over decades and decades of data center development both from a hardware,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.24,0:30:29.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also from a software and infrastructure perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.64,0:30:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moreover, our ODM partners are bringing Xeon 6 Plus solutions to the market today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.60,0:30:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, these range from full rack scale deployments to server level designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.44,0:30:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xeon 6 Plus joins our lineup of data center processors next to our already launched Xeon 6 based on P-cores.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.52,0:31:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Both of these category and class of solutions delivers new performance and choice
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.85,0:31:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,for all the enterprises whose infrastructure backbone is built on x86 and Xeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.80,0:31:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is critical for enterprises that need to increasingly balance preparing for AI workloads,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.52,0:31:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,but at the same time running their day-to-day mission-critical applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.20,0:31:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's switch gears and talk about how Intel would simplify the deployment of intelligence at scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.36,0:31:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's undeniable that enterprise infrastructure today will have to evolve to keep up with the AI demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.88,0:31:45.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Recent research forecast that AI inference workloads are expected to become 40%
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.34,0:31:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,of all data center power demand and much more than they are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.12,0:31:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we have these two paradigms where we have the foundational data centers keep on running their traditional workloads,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.76,0:32:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,but at the same time they have to figure out ways of building their infrastructures to serve intelligence at scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.76,0:32:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is where Intel and Xeon 6 Plus come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.76,0:32:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, up to now training split the data center into two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.84,0:32:29.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, on one hand we have CPU led enterprise infrastructure and the other hand we have GPU heavy AI factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.51,0:32:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that was very clear divide for a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.99,0:32:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we've all been accustomed to that that reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.28,0:32:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as a gigantic AI moves into real workloads, data, tools, governance, the needs change.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.32,0:32:49.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next wave is not just about training models, it is about putting AI to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's look at why a genetic AI changes the infrastructure equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.60,0:32:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way AI inference works is straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.48,0:32:59.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We take a prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.04,0:33:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It gets fed into an LLM where it spends most time reasoning about the prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.56,0:33:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we all seen this, we've done this of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And out comes an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.04,0:33:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this case, a lot of time is spent computing the large language model, which is mostly GPU and compute intensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the way a genetic AI works is radically different.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.00,0:33:27.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's given goals rather than prompts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.08,0:33:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we've all seen the uh the different types of loop that people are running on this genetic AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's also very iterative in nature, but also prompted by automation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.36,0:33:45.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And thinking, planning, acting, and reflecting are a natural way of these agents interacting with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.92,0:33:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,As it works, it uses tools, reads and writes files, checks rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.12,0:33:57.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and other aspects that were you know, in the traditional realm of CPUs and x86.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.00,0:34:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then for each step, the type of underlying compute needs is very different and we'll show that in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.36,0:34:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is particularly important as agents scale up their work, spawning new agents that work concurrently.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.36,0:34:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the category and the complexity of agents are going to be very different depending on the complexity of the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.12,0:34:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the main reason that there's such a rapid increase in CPU demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,For a genetic AI, the CPU orchestrates the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.60,0:34:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what we're seeing is we're also seeing the balance and the ratio of one CPU to eight GPU and more is is coming much closer to parity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.24,0:34:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let's take a look at the real example.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.64,0:34:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,John.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.64,0:34:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kevork.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.40,0:34:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You talked about how agentic AI is changing the compute requirements.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.89,0:34:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at a real example.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.20,0:34:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a traditional AI inference setup on the left-hand side of the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.96,0:34:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's send a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.72,0:35:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Write a Python function that calls an OpenAI compatible chat completions API.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.84,0:35:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The model gets the response, generates code, and sends the request back.
