Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.96,0:36:30.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, this is pretty amazing and some data to ponder on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.96,0:36:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,By far, the the density of CPU we showed is is has the highest density per rack ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.64,0:36:44.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,But also, looking at the number of agents, and these are the new metrics that are emerging,
