Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.56,0:36:53.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, good news to all the CIOs in the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.70,0:37:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, your very expensive GPUs can be can see more utilization because of our solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.32,0:37:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what's Xeon 6 with P-cores and E-cores are built and for intelligence at scale.
