Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.08,0:37:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we've seen all the workloads, we've run all the analysis, and we are delivering these solutions to to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.28,0:37:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, having said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.04,0:37:43.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are working with our customers and partners to make sure that each solution is tailored to to your needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.67,0:37:51.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'd like to welcome Libu back on stage to talk about the server and rack sale solutions that our partners are working on.
