Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.32,0:38:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is great to see the momentum in the data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.20,0:38:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,As we look forward to see that is for intelligence at scale, discrete compute alone is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our customer are asking us to think of system level to help them surf real authentic workloads at scale.
