Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.16,0:40:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.80,0:40:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I'm so excited to be here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.48,0:40:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wonderful product and amazing event.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.28,0:40:15.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jerry, Intel and Foxconn have been working together to many decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.23,0:40:25.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Foxconn has been instrumental in driving technology innovation in Taiwan and around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:26.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right, Lip-Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I'm proud the work we have done together from AI servers to data centers and to edge computing all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.36,0:40:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we're excited to announce the next step in our partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.68,0:40:52.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel and Foxconn are working together to develop rack-scale products built upon Intel Xeon processors.
