Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.15,0:44:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.72,0:44:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earlier this year, we announced a multi-year collaboration to deliver high-performance,
