Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.08,0:44:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been building something really special, excited to show you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.36,0:45:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the This is the SM50 SambaRack we announced earlier this year,
