Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.32,0:47:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this gives us an early look at how fast this can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.40,0:47:07.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rodrigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.10,0:47:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most exciting part about all this is that we have tremendous customer interest in these solutions.
