Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.00,0:51:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,they are increasingly looking for silicon built around their exact needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.68,0:51:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next, I would like to invite Srini,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.44,0:51:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,a semiconductor design veteran and the leader of our purpose-built silicon team to talk more about the work we are doing in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.88,0:51:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Srini.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.56,0:51:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi Libu, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.93,0:51:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.24,0:51:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A very good afternoon to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.12,0:52:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Purpose-built silicon it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.16,0:52:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This has been a journey that the industry industry has been using almost for the last decade or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.88,0:52:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And especially the hyperscalers have tapped into this to its full potential and shown us the benefits in every way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.52,0:52:17.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Libu, last year you challenged us to say in this space,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.39,0:52:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,given the fantastic assets and the breadth of assets that we have at Intel, how could we be relevant to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.13,0:52:27.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just be focused on the stuff that we do internally.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.14,0:52:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do we bring this out to the external world and do something more?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.00,0:52:34.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,With that said, we we had a proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.14,0:52:36.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.08,0:52:40.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today, I'm very happy to share a couple of good outcomes that we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.92,0:52:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first on the hyperscaler side,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.20,0:52:46.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have Google and Intel our Google and Intel have gone into a
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.00,0:52:52.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,partnership wherein Intel is delivering what is called as the infrastructure processing unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.83,0:52:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would call it Intel processing unit, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.52,0:53:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,But infrastructure processing unit, which is a a piece of silicon very vital for hyperscalers performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.52,0:53:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the journey journey continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.14,0:53:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And by the way, this is a deployment today, so it is not just something that we are doing, but it's already designed and being deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.12,0:53:18.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,While this is this is working on, we've been Intel as a company has been pretty active in the telco market.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.55,0:53:24.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in this telco market, another market customer, Ericsson, has been uh partnering with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.83,0:53:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Ericsson chooses us wherein we deliver our Intel delivers the next
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.08,0:53:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,generation infrastructure silicon for at a global scale for them across the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.64,0:53:42.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,This just gives you a very sneak preview at the highest level to see the kind of work that's happening in the purpose-built silicon space,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.58,0:53:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is a very exciting space, and more importantly a high-growth space.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.76,0:53:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I was just thinking, what better place than Computex on Taipei,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.25,0:54:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,where custom silicon really is the name of the game here, to announce that Intel has officially entered this market.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.25,0:54:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, looking forward to working with many of you guys, and see how we can be relevant to you some of your aspirational goals on silicon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.81,0:54:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.40,0:54:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lip-Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.04,0:54:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited about all these partnership that you announced, and more to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.40,0:54:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely more to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.64,0:54:20.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Lip-Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.19,0:54:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.64,0:54:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The work Sweeny and the team are doing with purpose-built silicon is really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.29,0:54:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited to be partnering to build custom silicon with many leading-edge companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.68,0:54:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,as well as some of the most dynamic startups across the industry vertical.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.88,0:54:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to highlight some of this partnership today.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.92,0:54:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the most exciting areas where we can deploy advanced silicon is biomedical engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.72,0:55:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,For years, emulating the function and functionality of the human brain has been the holy grail of computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.52,0:55:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,One company that is in the forefront of brain inspired computing is Echo Neurotechnologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.28,0:55:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us hear more from Eddie Chan, founder CEO of Echo Neurotechnology,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.96,0:55:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and also one of the world's best neurosurgeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.40,0:55:29.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Eddie Chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.51,0:55:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm a neurosurgeon at UCSF and co-founder of Echo Neurotechnologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.88,0:55:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,For decades, AI has been brain-inspired, meaning borrowing ideas from neuroscience at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.64,0:55:45.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Neuromorphic computing has carried that vision the furthest.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.94,0:55:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It builds silicon around the brain's core principles like spike sparse communication, memory, and compute all in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.76,0:55:55.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,That architecture is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.43,0:56:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But what's been missing is direct evidence of how the brain actually performs the computation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.16,0:56:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's now within our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.36,0:56:14.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the first time, we can study how the human cortex computes language in real time at the resolution where computation actually happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.08,0:56:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This opens a whole new possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.00,0:56:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Algorithms that are not just brain-inspired, but new ones that are trained on the brain activity itself, measured against the brain itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.80,0:56:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the shift in our collaboration with Intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.80,0:56:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together, we're developing brain-trained algorithms for streaming speech that approach the efficiency of biological computation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.96,0:56:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The payoff runs both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.08,0:56:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that's faster, lighter, and closer to how we actually think.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.12,0:56:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And new tools to restore speech to people who have lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.24,0:56:57.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together with Intel, we're building AI that learns from the most powerful computer ever discovered, the human brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.88,0:56:59.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're excited about what's ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.75,0:57:01.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.88,0:57:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.28,0:57:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed by the work you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.04,0:57:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm confident that our work together will help lay the foundation of highly efficient AI computers in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.32,0:57:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another company doing work at the cutting edge of biology is Greenstone Technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.40,0:57:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are partnering with Greenstone to establish scalable reference
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.24,0:57:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,architectures applicable across the broader life size imaging ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.24,0:57:46.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dr. Joseph Wu is a head of cardiology at Stanford and the founder CEO of Greenstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.71,0:57:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's hear from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.36,0:57:49.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.77,0:57:53.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,my name's uh Joseph Wu and I'm a professor of medicine and director
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.30,0:57:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Stanford Cardiovascular Institute as well as the co-founder of Greenstone Biosciences.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.17,0:58:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for including me in Computex.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.85,0:58:07.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel and Greenstone are working together to speed up the development of new medicines.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.50,0:58:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partnership combines state-of-the-art human genetics and biology from Greenstone with
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.00,0:58:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,advanced AI computing from Intel so that we can scale data processing,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.41,0:58:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,storage, and analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.64,0:58:25.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greenstone has built the world's largest biobank of human-induced pluripotent stem cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.66,0:58:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,From just 10 cc's of your blood, we can make your brain, heart, liver, kidney, gut,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.12,0:58:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and any type of organoids in your body that are genetically identical to the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.92,0:58:44.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,This will then allow us to test existing and new medications more quickly and at a lower cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.87,0:58:53.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,I believe the combination of human biology and AI computing will help shape the future of biomedicines in the next decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.78,0:59:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is why we're so excited about the partnership between Intel and Greenstone Biosciences.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.28,0:59:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much and enjoy the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.84,0:59:08.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xie Xie Da Jia.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.92,0:59:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.48,0:59:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed by the work you are doing and I'm excited about the potential of our partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.64,0:59:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another key partners is Hitachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.96,0:59:30.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have a wide range of capabilities that help accelerating our our work,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.02,0:59:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,our plan around foundry tools and quantum computing system.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.48,0:59:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us hear from Hitachi CEO Toku Naga-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.00,0:59:44.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello Computex.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.30,0:59:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm Toshiaki Tokunaga, CEO of Hitachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.96,0:59:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,For decades, Hitachi and Intel have worked together to solve key challenges for society.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.84,0:59:56.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.71,1:00:02.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are bringing our strength even closer by combining Intel's
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.53,1:00:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,advanced computing with Hitachi's industrial strength in the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.84,1:00:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will create intelligent solutions that will benefit both businesses and society.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.92,1:00:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lip-Bu.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.16,1:00:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I look forward to our future together.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.24,1:00:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, TT.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.40,1:00:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm really looking forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.68,1:00:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, uh if you look at in uh we have the brains-inspired computing, biomedical medicine, and then energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.48,1:00:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last one is industrial automation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.28,1:00:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, one partner I would like to hear like you to hear from is known for their pioneering work in industrial automation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.51,1:01:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let us hear from my very good friend uh Roland Busch at Siemens.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.08,1:01:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi, Lip-Bu.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.68,1:01:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a customer of Intel, we all know that global semiconductor demand has hit a high record.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.64,1:01:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 2023, Siemens and Intel already joined forces to meet it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.00,1:01:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, we are taking our collaboration to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.69,1:01:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are expanding our partnership across the entire value chain from design to manufacturing to chip applications in Siemens products.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.40,1:01:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We improve design quality through EDA automation and software solutions built with a genetic AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.04,1:01:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We partner on all areas of the manufacturing process including product lifecycle management automation electrification quality and sustainability.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.40,1:02:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what makes this even more relevant for us the chips created in this value chain will be used in our own Siemens products.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.24,1:02:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to what's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.28,1:02:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Roland.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.64,1:02:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are delighted to expand our long partnership with the Siemens groups.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.12,1:02:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to disclose more about this partnership in the coming months.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.32,1:02:37.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are working with several other partners to keep pushing the boundary of what is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.16,1:02:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to close by returning to where we start our conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.36,1:02:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The opportunity for Intel and for our partners is immense.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.88,1:02:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,PC edge a genetic physical AI data center and emerging intelligence center.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.48,1:03:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,From silicon to SOC to system and applications.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.64,1:03:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This opportunity is only made possible by all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.76,1:03:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at the list.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.24,1:03:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the largest ecosystem of partners, suppliers, and customer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.92,1:03:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel is an iconic company.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.88,1:03:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We laid the foundation of modern-day computing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.16,1:03:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are proud of our heritage.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.64,1:03:38.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we do not want to rest on our honors and gloria.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.04,1:03:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,A year ago, I joined as a CEO.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.48,1:03:49.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I challenged my team to work with me to build a new Intel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.80,1:03:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is exactly what we are doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.40,1:03:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are not encumbered by the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.20,1:04:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are building something wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.20,1:04:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has been year of transformation for Intel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.88,1:04:10.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We ramp our 18A to high volume with multiple products.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.56,1:04:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are executing well on our advanced packaging milestones.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.96,1:04:22.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We make tremendous progress on engaging customers and building our foundry business.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.56,1:04:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We introduced new SOCs for all major compute
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.92,1:04:36.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,platforms from premium mobile to high-density cloud and 5G.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.92,1:04:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are rebuilding and strengthening partnership across the ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.20,1:04:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are double down on creating new business opportunity across existing and emerging domains.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.36,1:05:04.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are working at the forefront to imagine reimagine computing and make it highly efficient for the AI era.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.04,1:05:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.56,1:05:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited to continue executing at hyper speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.76,1:05:23.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before the lights go out, the race begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.88,1:05:33.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,From simulation to strategy, performance begins with compute, with electrons that power pace, and data that backs decisions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.40,1:05:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The race never ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Engineering never stops.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.60,1:05:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intel, official compute partner of McLaren Racing.
